{
  "$schema": "https://open-design.ai/schemas/plugin.v1.json",
  "specVersion": "1.0.0",
  "name": "example-hps-academic-paper",
  "title": "Academic Paper",
  "title_i18n": {
    "en": "Academic Paper",
    "zh-CN": "学术论文风"
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "LaTeX-paper deck theme: paper-white #fdfcf8 ground, all-serif type (Latin Modern Roman with Playfair Display fallback), ink-black body, link-blue #1a3a7a underlined citation anchors, italic kickers, zero radius and near-zero shadow, double-rule title page, numbered Figure/Table captions and booktabs three-line tables. Single-file HTML deck with keyboard navigation and hash deep links — for conference talks, thesis defenses, research reviews and journal clubs. Based on lewislulu/html-ppt-skill academic-paper.",
  "description_i18n": {
    "en": "LaTeX-paper deck theme: paper-white #fdfcf8 ground, all-serif type (Latin Modern Roman with Playfair Display fallback), ink-black body, link-blue #1a3a7a underlined citation anchors, italic kickers, zero radius and near-zero shadow, double-rule title page, numbered Figure/Table captions and booktabs three-line tables. Single-file HTML deck with keyboard navigation and hash deep links — for conference talks, thesis defenses, research reviews and journal clubs. Based on lewislulu/html-ppt-skill academic-paper.",
    "zh-CN": "「学术论文风」幻灯片主题：纸白 #fdfcf8 底色全衬线排印（Latin Modern Roman，Playfair Display 兜底），墨黑正文 + 链接蓝 #1a3a7a 下划线引用锚点 + 斜体 kicker，零圆角近零阴影，双规则线扉页、带编号的 Figure/Table 图注与 booktabs 三线表。零依赖单文件 HTML，键盘导航 + hash 直达——适合学术会议报告、论文答辩、研究评审与组会分享。移植自 lewislulu/html-ppt-skill 的 academic-paper 主题。"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": {
    "name": "lewislulu",
    "url": "https://github.com/lewislulu"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/lewislulu/html-ppt-skill",
  "plugin": {
    "repo": "https://github.com/lewislulu/html-ppt-skill"
  },
  "tags": [
    "community",
    "deck",
    "slides",
    "presentation",
    "academic",
    "paper",
    "serif",
    "latex",
    "light"
  ],
  "compat": {
    "agentSkills": [
      {
        "path": "./SKILL.md"
      }
    ]
  },
  "od": {
    "kind": "scenario",
    "taskKind": "new-generation",
    "mode": "deck",
    "scenario": "product",
    "surface": "web",
    "preview": {
      "type": "html",
      "entry": "./example.html",
      "motion": "deck"
    },
    "useCase": {
      "query": {
        "en": "Create an Academic Paper deck about {{topic}} for {{audience}} ({{slideCount}}, {{density}}): a conference-talk presentation in the locked academic-paper theme from lewislulu/html-ppt-skill. Output one self-contained single-file HTML deck with zero dependencies — all CSS/JS inline, no build step, no external JS libraries, no CDN scripts, no remote images; only Google Fonts @import (Playfair Display incl. italics, Noto Serif SC, JetBrains Mono) is allowed. THEME IS LOCKED — reproduce exactly: (a) Tokens: --bg:#fdfcf8; --bg-soft:#f7f5ed; --surface:#ffffff; --surface-2:#f5f3ea; --border:rgba(20,20,20,.14); --border-strong:rgba(20,20,20,.35); --text-1:#0a0a0a; --text-2:#333333; --text-3:#707070; --accent:#1a3a7a (link blue — citations, 'ours' data, best numbers); --accent-2:#0a0a0a (ink); --accent-3:#8a1a1a (sparing dark red, errata/negative only); --good:#1a5a2a; --warn:#8a6a1a; --bad:#8a1a1a; --grad:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a3a7a,#0a0a0a); --grad-soft:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8edf8,#f5f3ea); --radius/--radius-sm/--radius-lg:0px; --shadow:none; --shadow-lg:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.1); all three font slots serif: 'Latin Modern Roman','Playfair Display','Noto Serif SC',Georgia,serif; --font-mono:'JetBrains Mono'; --letter-tight:-.01em; --letter-normal:0; --ease:cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1). Zero rounded corners, no shadows, no colors outside this palette. (b) Typographic register: headings weight 700 sentence case (never uppercase), body 400 line-height 1.6, .kicker is the signature — italic, link blue, sentence case, letter-spacing 0, weight 400; links and [n] .cite anchors are link-blue underlined; tabular-nums for all data. (c) Academic devices on the right pages: .rule-double LaTeX titlepage double rule on the cover; .abstract italic block between hairline rules with a bold lead word; numbered captions on EVERY figure and table (.figure/.figcaption 'Figure 1: …', booktabs 'Table 1: …'); .booktabs three-line tables (2px top/bottom, 1px header rule, never vertical rules, .best winners bold blue); .footnote dagger small print under a hairline rule; .references hanging-[n] bibliography on the closing page. (d) Slide system: <div class=\"deck\" id=\"deck\"> horizontal scroll-snap strip of <section class=\"slide\" data-title=\"…\">, each exactly 100vw×100vh (16:9, 1280×720 baseline, clamp() fluid type), padding 72px 96px, one screen per slide, no internal scrolling; fixed chrome .deck-header (italic running head) / .deck-footer (attribution + N/total counter) / 2px link-blue .progress-bar. (e) Navigation: keep the seed script verbatim — arrows/Space/PageUp/PageDown/Home/End, #/N hash routing via history.replaceState in try/catch, dual capture-phase key listeners with Event-identity dedupe, scroll sync, body auto-focus; this variant is theme-locked with no T cycling. (f) Visuals: diagrams are ink-line inline SVG (1.5px strokes, serif labels, 'ours' boxes tinted #e8edf8/link blue); charts are pure CSS bars on a heavy ink axis — muted --surface-2 baselines and exactly one link-blue 'ours' bar; no Chart.js/mermaid, no external images, icons inline SVG only. (g) Layout masters to compose from (all in example.html): double-rule title page with superscript author affiliations, .toc-list numbered outline, ghost-numeral section divider, abstract+contributions two-column, giant link-blue stat with CI footnote, SVG method figure, CSS results bar chart, booktabs comparison table, italic epigraph quote with precise attribution, two-card conclusions, references closer. (h) Motion restraint: at most one rise/fade hero plus one stagger list per slide — no 3D, no glitch, no confetti. Write real content with real numbers and plausibly formatted citations — no lorem ipsum; 1–3 sentences of speaker notes per slide in a hidden .notes div. Start from the example.html seed shipped in this plugin: keep its token sheet, base CSS, academic device classes, chrome and navigation script verbatim; replace only the slide content. Do not introduce any color or font outside this specification and do not redesign the theme.",
        "zh-CN": "用「学术论文风 Academic Paper」主题为 {{audience}} 创作一套关于 {{topic}} 的学术报告（{{slideCount}}，{{density}}）：LaTeX 论文质感——纸白 #fdfcf8 底全衬线（Latin Modern Roman / Playfair Display 兜底），墨黑正文 + 链接蓝 #1a3a7a 下划线引用锚点 + 斜体 kicker，零圆角近零阴影；封面双规则线扉页，每个图表必须带编号图注（Figure 1 / Table 1），表格用 booktabs 三线表，结尾页悬挂 [n] 参考文献。零依赖单文件 HTML：横向 scroll-snap 的 section.slide 一屏一页，键盘翻页 + #/N hash 直达，图示用墨线 inline SVG、图表用纯 CSS 条形图（唯一一根链接蓝 'ours' 柱），动效克制。从插件内 example.html 种子出发：保留全部设计 token、学术装置类、页面骨架和导航脚本，只替换内容；禁止引入规格之外的颜色和字体。完整硬性规格以英文 prompt 为准。"
      },
      "exampleOutputs": [
        {
          "path": "./example.html",
          "title": "DAMC conference talk — Academic Paper deck",
          "title_i18n": {
            "en": "DAMC conference talk — Academic Paper deck",
            "zh-CN": "DAMC 学术会议报告 · 学术论文风"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "inputs": [
      {
        "name": "topic",
        "label": "Topic",
        "type": "string",
        "required": true,
        "placeholder": "A paper, a thesis chapter, a research review, a journal-club pick…",
        "default": "the user's brief"
      },
      {
        "name": "audience",
        "label": "Audience",
        "type": "string",
        "required": true,
        "placeholder": "Conference session, thesis committee, lab group, students…",
        "default": "an academic audience"
      },
      {
        "name": "slideCount",
        "label": "Length",
        "type": "select",
        "required": true,
        "options": [
          "short 8-11 slides",
          "medium 12-18 slides",
          "long 18+ slides"
        ],
        "default": "short 8-11 slides"
      },
      {
        "name": "density",
        "label": "Density",
        "type": "select",
        "required": true,
        "options": [
          "low density / talk-led",
          "high density / reading-first"
        ],
        "default": "low density / talk-led"
      }
    ],
    "context": {
      "skills": [
        {
          "path": "./SKILL.md"
        }
      ],
      "assets": [
        "./example.html"
      ]
    },
    "pipeline": {
      "stages": [
        {
          "id": "discovery",
          "atoms": [
            "discovery-question-form"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "generate",
          "atoms": [
            "file-write",
            "live-artifact"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "capabilities": [
      "prompt:inject",
      "fs:write"
    ]
  }
}
